				Time="2011-09-07T03:33:40" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T03:33:40" />
