		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d10r0501_swsage01_17"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>みとめるか……！
ありえるか……！▼
ポケモンなる
どうぐを　つかいこなせぬ▼
おろかな　ものたちに
おくれを　とるとは！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-26T04:07:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T03:33:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>認めるか……！
ありえるか……！▼
ポケモンなる
道具を　使いこなせぬ▼
愚かな　者たちに
遅れを　とるとは！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-26T04:07:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T03:33:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・左右にウロウロしたあと
　画面上を向いてメッセージ表示
・続けてboss_05</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T03:33:40" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1B
ゲーチス・杖なし</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T02:35:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
